					"nextDialogs": [
						120440920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yumemizuki Mizuki"
				},
				{
					"id": 120440920,
					"content": "I've eaten so many bad dreams today that I just scarfed it down without noticing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120440921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yumemizuki Mizuki"
				},
				{
					"id": 120440921,
					"content": "So yumekui-baku can eat good dreams too, huh... Still, is that really such a big deal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120440922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 120440922,
					"content": "Of course it is. Dreams are some of the most precious things a person can have, and I just went and gobbled it down...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120440923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Yumemizuki Mizuki"
				},
				{
					"id": 120440923,
					"content": "It's the unwritten rule of my kind: Never eat someone else's good dreams without permission. I can't believe I was so careless.",
